+
+// Bluetooth for Chromium built for Linux on Android's libc (Spatiand's SpatiMesh
+// on the Beam Pro): Android's Bluetooth LE, reached through the Spatiand app's
+// bridge (android/src/id/prasetya/spatiand/BluetoothBridge.java), an abstract
+// socket "spatiand-bluetooth" that carries one JSON object a line each way.
+// Chromium's Linux build reaches Bluetooth through BlueZ on D-Bus, which
+// Android has not got. Low energy, central, GATT client: what Web Bluetooth
+// asks for.
+
+#include <memory>
